{
  "slug": "saleshandy",
  "name": "Saleshandy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Saleshandy prospecting and enrichment for Claude Code — natural-language ICP search and one-shot lead enrichment, wired through the Saleshandy MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `discover-and-enroll` (ICP-driven prospecting via Saleshandy Lead Finder), `enrich-leads` (Reveal verified work email (and optionally phone) for a person or company via Saleshandy Lead Finder)\n- **Commands** (2): `discover-and-enroll` (ICP-driven prospecting — natural-language search, enrich, and (optionally) enroll into a sequence step), `enrich-leads` (Reveal verified work email (and optionally phone) for a person or company)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `saleshandy`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install saleshandy@claude-community` from `saleshandy/saleshandy-plugin`.",
